{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04432","headline":"酬李参军崇嗣旅馆见赠 · 陈子昂","name":"酬李参军崇嗣旅馆见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜银河畔，星文犯遥汉。\n今朝紫气新，物色果逢真。\n言从天上落，乃是地仙人。\n白璧疑冤楚，乌裘似入秦。\n摧藏多古意，历览备艰辛。\n乐广云虽覩，夷吾风未春。\n凤歌空有问，龙性讵能驯。\n宝劒终应出，骊珠会见珍。\n未及冯公老，何惊孺子贫。\n青云傥可致，北海忆孙宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}